scripts/prompts/review-checklist.md:119:## What not to do
scripts/prompts/review-checklist.md:121:- Do not rebuild the absolutes checker (§6 above exists precisely to stop you doing this).
scripts/prompts/review-checklist.md:125:- Do not flag a `.owed` block for lacking a counter-case — that is the honest, intended state, not a
